{"v":4,"catch":"Chess Brain 是一款國際象棋益智遊戲。繪製正確的路徑，不要讓國王被對面的棋子殺死！每一秒所有的碎片都會移動！","desc":"Chess Brain 是一款國際象棋益智遊戲。\n\n國王必須到達目的地。\n畫出正確的路徑，不要讓它被對面的棋子殺死！\n每一秒所有的碎片都會移動！\n\n解決 30 個謎題！有些可能很簡單，但有些會讓你提前思考每一秒！\n\n正確的路徑將帶你到達目的地！","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2021-11-11","genres":["桌上遊戲","策略","學習","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/22a1f0362607c49be4110539e12afa9ef33491de99bd18c691229518dc9a80d7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/64dca22406406c8583067899711364c9faf14e58ee9fba9362c2e07ad2f972f3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f37b807caca32b9abf92e59aed191017d340c234d0d5f7ff4a70e9a274c5347f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c65668afc3b466e61e5e1a60a635393802abc761eefd35f66c074f8b642d2caa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3ad88dc869899777964d626a3b755ae6d233115334f416cdc60f236092c4b61c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100cf9015a60000","dlc":[]}